* Directories
	= DB names

* Files in directories
	.credentials ... user creation script
	db.struc.sql ... database structure
	table.TABLE.data.sql ... data for table TABLE, please, for single inserted row on line use something like: sed 's/),(/),\n(/g'

* Export
	You can use dbdump.sh script (see inside) for export (will remove and recreate directory of dumped DB!!!), use at your own risk.
	Files $DBNAME_tables are used by dbdump.sh, contain all tables at time of their creation, only tables listed will be exported during dump.
